&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 108%; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 108%; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-weight: bold;"&gt;5. Commitments and Contingencies&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; text-indent: 36pt; line-height: 108%; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;The Company is subject to a variety of risks, including regulations by the FERC, in the normal course of its business The Company is not aware of any material contingent liabilities with respect to any legal actions or compliance with applicable environmental laws and regulations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 108%; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-weight: bold;"&gt;6. Regulatory Matters&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; text-indent: 36pt; line-height: 108%; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;The FERC has jurisdiction over the Company&amp;#8217;s operations with respect to transportation of gas, rates and charges, construction of new facilities, extension or abandonment of service facilities, accounts and records, depreciation and amortization policies and certain other matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 108%; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-weight: bold;"&gt;7. Significant Customers and Concentration of Credit Risk&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; text-indent: 36pt; line-height: 108%; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;Financial instruments that potentially expose the Company to the concentration of credit risk consist primarily of customer accounts receivables, which are generally unsecured. The Company transports gas on the Hobbs pipeline for a single customer. Accordingly, this customer accounted for 100% of revenue for the years ended December 31, 2025.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 108%; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-weight: bold;"&gt;8. Subsequent Events&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; text-indent: 36pt; line-height: 108%; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;The Company has evaluated subsequent events from the balance sheet date through &lt;font style="background-color: #ffff00;"&gt;April 15, 202&lt;/font&gt;6, the date the financial statements were issued, and determined that there are no material subsequent events that required additional disclosure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 108%; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 108%; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 108%; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 108%; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 108%; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 108%; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
